# 仓库内统一存 LF，检出时按平台还原，避免 Windows/macOS 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 goto/label 等语法可能出错
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 显式声明二进制，禁止任何换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 语言统计时把构建产物与 lockfile 排除，GitHub 首页语言条更准确
Fretboard-Lab.html linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated
